---

---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="heading-accent">01. About Me</p>
      <h2 class="heading">A Bit About Myself</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed">
          I'm a Systems Administrator and DevOps Engineer with a passion for building secure, automated infrastructure.
          Currently, I'm the <span class="text-accent">Owner of CK Technology LLC</span>, where I focus on delivering
          enterprise-grade IT solutions for businesses of all sizes. Previously, I worked as a
          <span class="text-accent">Systems Administrator at Resolve Technology</span>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed">
          My journey in tech started with a curiosity for how systems work under the hood. That curiosity evolved into
          a career spanning systems administration, network security, cloud infrastructure, and software development.
          I hold a <span class="text-accent">B.S. in Software Development from SNHU</span> and maintain certifications
          including CompTIA Security+, Network+, Linux+, and Cisco CCNA.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed">
          When I'm not managing infrastructure or writing code, you'll find me exploring new technologies,
          contributing to open-source projects, or diving deep into Rust and Zig development. I believe in
          building systems that are not just functional, but elegant and maintainable.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Here are some technologies I've been working with recently:
        </p>

        <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 font-mono text-sm">
          {['Arch Linux', 'Proxmox VE', 'Docker/Podman', 'Rust', 'Zig', 'Azure/M365', 'FortiGate', 'Terraform'].map(tech => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate">
              <span class="text-accent">▹</span> {tech}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Profile Image -->
      <div class="reveal flex justify-center md:justify-end" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="relative group">
          <!-- Decorative border -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 border-2 border-accent rounded-lg translate-x-4 translate-y-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:translate-y-2"></div>

          <!-- Image container -->
          <div class="relative w-64 h-64 md:w-72 md:h-72 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-accent/10">
            <img
              src="/profile.jpg"
              alt="Christopher Kelley"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
            />
            <!-- Overlay -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-accent/20 hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
